  "title": "Jim&#39;s Beer-Battered Portobello Mushrooms",
  "description": "Jim&#39;s beer-battered portobello mushroom recipe calls for dipping portobello mushroom strips in beer batter and deep-frying them until they&#39;re crunchy.",
